{"meta":{"id":"union","category":"it/syntax/typescript/type-combination","title":"유니온 타입 (Union) · TS","subtitle":"(TYPESCRIPT)","summary":"string | number 처럼 여러 타입 중 하나를 허용 — 타입 지정, typeof 로 좁히기","tags":["typescript","f-union"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-indigo","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>TYPESCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">유니온 타입 (Union) · TS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/70 border border-indigo-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> string | number 처럼 여러 타입 중 하나를 허용 — 타입 지정, typeof 로 좁히기</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">유니온 타입 — 타입 지정</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">let id: string | number;\r\nid = &quot;u-001&quot;;\r\nid = 1001;\r\n// id = true;          // 오류: string | number 만 허용\r\n\r\ntype Result = Success | Failure;</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>|</code> 로 <strong>여러 타입 중 하나</strong>를 허용한다</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">타입 좁히기 (narrowing)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">function format(id: string | number) {\r\n  if (typeof id === &quot;string&quot;) {\r\n    return id.toUpperCase();   // 여기서는 string\r\n  }\r\n  return id.toFixed(0);        // 여기서는 number\r\n}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">유니온 값은 공통 기능만 바로 쓸 수 있고, <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>typeof</code> / <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>in</code> / <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>instanceof</code> 로 좁힌 뒤 각 타입의 기능을 쓴다</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">구분된 유니온 (Discriminated Union)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">type Success = { status: &quot;ok&quot;; data: string };\r\ntype Failure = { status: &quot;error&quot;; message: string };\r\n\r\nfunction handle(r: Success | Failure) {\r\n  switch (r.status) {\r\n    case &quot;ok&quot;:    return r.data;     // Success\r\n    case &quot;error&quot;: return r.message;  // Failure\r\n  }\r\n}</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> 리터럴 타입(status 값)과 함께 사용</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/typescript/type-combination/union","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"typescript","title":"TYPESCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/typescript"},{"id":"type-combination","title":"타입 조합 · 제한","path":"it/syntax/typescript/type-combination"}],"hasImage":false}